        <mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;PinChange&lt;/span&gt; carries appliesOnNextLoad: a running model keeps its build; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;start&lt;/span&gt; picks one with &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;pins::select&lt;/span&gt; (model pin, global pin, automatic) on the next load. A request needing vision, tools or JSON-schema output is checked first: engine_build_too_old (503), capability_unsupported (400).&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#14171C,#ECEEF1);rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#C4C7CD,#353A42);fillColor=light-dark(#F0F2F5,#1B1E23);align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="962" y="1083" width="420" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
